<title>UK: Allied Leisure H1 pretax profit jumps.</title>
<headline>Allied Leisure H1 pretax profit jumps.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		1.07		   vs 0.63</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 0.33		   vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     1.4		    vs 0.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   18.9		   vs 9.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Leisure operator Allied Leisure Plc said its first half performance was boosted by strong like-for-like summer sales. In the first seven weeks of the second half like-for-like growth has continued but sales are behind company expectations, the chairman said, adding, &quot;trading continues to be patchy&quot;.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
